WEBVTT

00:47.797 --> 00:51.676
DOONA!

01:02.312 --> 01:03.646
Who is that guy? Talk to me.

01:16.284 --> 01:17.494
Stay with me.

02:00.745 --> 02:01.704
Let's get going.

02:45.248 --> 02:48.168
EPISODE 7
CLEAR THE AIR

03:01.639 --> 03:02.599
Why are you here?

03:06.060 --> 03:07.228
Are you feeling sick?

03:16.863 --> 03:18.823
You're getting hot. It might be a fever.

03:22.452 --> 03:24.370
Is there something you want to say to me?

03:25.163 --> 03:27.790
Shouldn't you be the one
who has something to say to me?

03:30.919 --> 03:32.128
Let's talk when we're in Seoul.

03:37.467 --> 03:38.801
Your career's on the line.

03:38.885 --> 03:41.095
It's time to fix it
before the world forgets you.

03:41.679 --> 03:43.598
And what if I want to be forgotten?

03:45.391 --> 03:46.392
Both by you

03:47.143 --> 03:48.394
and by the public.

03:49.020 --> 03:51.522
What do you think you'll do
with your career if I told you that?

03:55.526 --> 03:56.736
I know you're just saying that,

03:57.654 --> 03:59.530
because I know what it is
you fear the most.

04:00.114 --> 04:02.325
Being forgotten and ending up all alone.

04:05.703 --> 04:06.913
So that's why you did it.

04:08.289 --> 04:10.416
Dumped me in that house all by myself

04:10.500 --> 04:12.669
and didn't bother
to come visit me even once…

04:15.255 --> 04:17.257
making me realize
what abandonment feels like.

04:19.300 --> 04:21.636
I quit, so you punished me. Is that it?

04:34.524 --> 04:35.441
I want out.

04:37.318 --> 04:38.444
Let me out of the car.

04:41.406 --> 04:42.824
I said I want out!

04:42.907 --> 04:44.826
I said stop the car!

04:49.080 --> 04:50.123
Hey, stop it.

04:51.708 --> 04:54.210
- I want out!
- I said stop it, Lee Doona!

04:54.294 --> 04:57.213
Would you stop it?

05:14.605 --> 05:16.232
- What do you think you're doing?
- Get away!

05:18.526 --> 05:19.986
Let go of me!

05:21.696 --> 05:23.364
Get away!

05:26.159 --> 05:27.243
Stop this now.

05:28.578 --> 05:29.829
Get ahold of yourself.

05:33.499 --> 05:34.876
That's enough! Stop, Doona!

05:43.134 --> 05:44.594
So I bet this was fun, huh?

05:45.303 --> 05:46.721
It made you feel good, huh?

05:47.221 --> 05:50.516
Because of you, I felt so alone
and like I was drowning every day.

05:52.602 --> 05:53.686
Don't be so dramatic.

05:53.770 --> 05:56.230
You're worse than my mother,
you narcissistic ass!

05:57.273 --> 05:59.067
You knew I liked you, and

05:59.734 --> 06:02.862
how desperate I was to see you,
and you just left me there.

06:04.238 --> 06:06.657
You manipulated me
and took me for granted, huh?

06:07.825 --> 06:09.952
I despise you, you fucking asshole.

06:15.792 --> 06:18.669
You and I know you didn't wait for me
because you had feelings.

06:20.421 --> 06:21.798
You always make a mess of things,

06:21.881 --> 06:24.258
and you always expect me
to fix it for you.

06:24.342 --> 06:25.968
You need a ticket back into this industry,

06:26.052 --> 06:27.595
and you know I'm that ticket.

06:27.678 --> 06:29.097
Tell me I'm wrong, huh?

06:31.516 --> 06:34.477
You actually think you really know
what it means to be in love, Doona?

06:36.687 --> 06:38.815
If you really did care at all for me,

06:38.898 --> 06:42.527
then you wouldn't have left us out to dry
and blown up everything we worked for.

06:42.610 --> 06:44.320
You're the reason the tour ended.

06:45.780 --> 06:47.782
Don't act like you're the victim here.
We are.

06:48.449 --> 06:50.118
I didn't use you, Lee Doona!

06:50.201 --> 06:52.078
It's the other way around, all right?

06:52.995 --> 06:55.748
You're the person who used us
to further your career, huh?

06:56.666 --> 06:58.084
You neglected yourself.

07:03.714 --> 07:05.049
You're a complete mess.

07:08.094 --> 07:10.721
Even still, you have no problem
messing up your life.

08:02.690 --> 08:03.816
RECENTS

08:03.900 --> 08:05.109
LEE DOONA

08:20.958 --> 08:21.876
Yes.

08:22.668 --> 08:26.964
Yeah, you're right. It is today.
Well, there's been a bit of an incident.

08:28.758 --> 08:30.218
Miss Lee Doona's guardian?

08:30.718 --> 08:31.552
Yes.

08:32.345 --> 08:34.764
No, no, I'll…
I'll be there today for sure.

08:35.681 --> 08:36.682
Yes, but

08:37.642 --> 08:39.310
do we really need to decide now?

08:40.436 --> 08:43.147
Yes. I'll get there later tonight.

08:44.732 --> 08:47.610
Okay. Don't forget to look
into that hospital I mentioned.

08:48.778 --> 08:50.238
Okay.

08:55.868 --> 08:59.580
LEE WON-JUN

09:43.249 --> 09:45.876
You have
this really great relationship with her,

09:46.711 --> 09:48.629
'cause you've known her so long.

09:49.213 --> 09:51.299
That's why I'm very jealous of you.

09:51.382 --> 09:52.800
These aren't mine.

09:57.179 --> 09:58.931
You've gotten better at lying.

09:59.432 --> 10:01.309
Stop contacting me and wait quietly.

10:45.686 --> 10:48.230
RECEIVED TWO TICKETS
FOR TODAY'S LAST BUS TO SEOUL

11:05.373 --> 11:06.540
MOM

11:28.187 --> 11:30.898
Get in the car,
unless you plan to never see me again.

11:32.775 --> 11:34.527
I used to fear words like that.

11:36.112 --> 11:38.531
Now your words
somehow no longer scare me at all.

11:41.534 --> 11:42.993
Well, do what you want, then.

11:43.077 --> 11:45.204
You won't see my face
from now on, you got it?

11:51.460 --> 11:52.795
What was the point, then?

11:52.878 --> 11:54.588
Why did you come to the showcase?

12:55.608 --> 12:59.570
KOOK'S SEAFOOD HOUSE

13:04.241 --> 13:07.787
Jeez, bro. Slow down.
What's up with you? You good?

13:11.332 --> 13:13.501
Why is everything hard for me?

13:16.754 --> 13:19.340
You know what's easy and simple? Math.

13:19.924 --> 13:22.343
It's only easy for you, dickhead.

13:25.721 --> 13:27.515
Ah.

13:31.101 --> 13:33.312
Who do celebrities date usually?
I have no idea.

13:33.395 --> 13:35.022
Hmm? Who?

13:37.441 --> 13:38.359
Oh.

13:39.026 --> 13:41.654
I guess they date someone like themselves.

13:42.321 --> 13:43.948
Others at the top of their game.

13:45.533 --> 13:48.035
But… if I were Doona…

13:49.203 --> 13:50.704
…Son Heung-min would be the guy.

13:50.788 --> 13:53.374
Oh wow! You see his free kick yesterday?

13:53.457 --> 13:55.334
The way he curved it was crazy.

13:55.417 --> 13:58.212
His is not the foot of a mere mortal.
No way, man.

13:58.295 --> 14:00.297
And I was a fan of Messi's
for the longest time.

14:00.381 --> 14:02.842
But now it's Son Heung-min all the way.

15:00.524 --> 15:02.818
RECENTS
LEE WON-JUN

15:23.255 --> 15:25.174
RECENTS
LEE WON-JUN

15:43.609 --> 15:47.112
What was the point, then?
Why did you come to the showcase?

16:17.559 --> 16:18.978
You dance, don't you?

16:19.061 --> 16:20.396
LEE DOONA

16:25.693 --> 16:26.735
You in eighth grade?

16:30.030 --> 16:32.658
All you have to do
is follow my directions.

16:32.741 --> 16:35.411
As long as you do,
you'll have nothing to worry about.

16:36.203 --> 16:38.622
Once you sign with us,
I'll take care of everything for you,

16:38.706 --> 16:40.791
where you stay, what you eat,

16:40.874 --> 16:42.167
even what you wear.

16:43.293 --> 16:46.130
But in return,
you can't ever keep anything from me.

16:46.714 --> 16:47.798
If you do, we're done.

16:48.966 --> 16:50.509
And why should I do that?

16:52.928 --> 16:55.222
Are we gonna be
like a family or something?

16:55.305 --> 16:56.473
Something like that.

16:57.725 --> 16:59.852
If that makes it easier
for you to understand.

17:33.302 --> 17:34.261
Does it hurt here?

17:37.556 --> 17:38.766
How about here?

17:51.862 --> 17:53.405
That's enough for today.

18:14.968 --> 18:17.137
Mmm! This place is good, right?

18:17.221 --> 18:18.305
Mmm!

18:18.388 --> 18:19.223
Ah!

18:22.267 --> 18:23.102
Ah!

18:25.521 --> 18:26.939
It's insanely good!

18:30.442 --> 18:33.403
Oh. Ah, the house feels so empty.

18:33.487 --> 18:34.404
Doesn't it?

18:40.410 --> 18:41.537
Yun-taek.

18:41.620 --> 18:43.247
- Yeah?
- Uh…

18:43.914 --> 18:46.583
- The other day there was this person--
- Who? A chick?

18:48.252 --> 18:49.294
Uh, no, it's just,

18:49.378 --> 18:52.840
I was with a friend and, well,
they kept acting happy around me.

18:52.923 --> 18:55.467
They would, uh… shake like this.

18:55.551 --> 18:57.761
Why do you think that person
keeps popping inside my head?

18:58.595 --> 19:01.390
- What are you trying to say?
- Uh…

19:05.102 --> 19:06.562
CHOI I-RA

19:28.375 --> 19:30.502
Huh. Well, hi!

19:30.586 --> 19:31.712
Hey.

19:31.795 --> 19:32.796
You got here fast.

19:33.380 --> 19:35.048
- You look busy.
- Oh, is…

19:35.132 --> 19:36.383
- Mmm.
- Aw, seriously?

19:36.466 --> 19:38.594
How did you know I was thirsty?
Thank you.

19:38.677 --> 19:39.595
Mm-hmm.

19:41.096 --> 19:42.472
Mmm!

19:42.556 --> 19:43.849
So refreshing! Mmm!

19:47.144 --> 19:48.854
What did you need help with?
You didn't say.

19:49.563 --> 19:50.480
Mmm.

19:51.356 --> 19:53.233
Our department's doing a fashion show.

19:53.859 --> 19:55.444
You don't need to model on stage,

19:55.527 --> 19:57.279
but could you please
help me with the fitting?

19:57.362 --> 19:59.656
I'll buy dinner afterwards.
Please help, hmm?

20:00.240 --> 20:01.241
Hmm…

20:02.117 --> 20:03.202
That's a yes!

20:03.785 --> 20:06.455
Okay, first,
can you just try this on for me?

20:06.538 --> 20:07.372
Here you go.

20:07.456 --> 20:08.874
You can change right over there,

20:08.957 --> 20:10.959
and if you need me,
I'll help you put it on as well.

20:11.043 --> 20:11.877
Huh?

20:12.544 --> 20:13.712
Okay…

20:32.481 --> 20:33.315
Hmm?

20:36.026 --> 20:39.154
Let me ask you this!
How could you do that so easily?

20:39.238 --> 20:42.658
That is definitely not true, I-ra.
I've never once given up on you.

20:42.741 --> 20:44.326
My heart has always been yours.

20:44.409 --> 20:45.702
Oh, give me a break.

20:45.786 --> 20:48.163
I've finally realized

20:48.247 --> 20:50.874
that you're the only woman in my life.

20:50.958 --> 20:51.959
Hey!

20:53.293 --> 20:55.504
What's wrong?
Did you run out of money again?

20:56.463 --> 20:57.297
Just so you know,

20:57.381 --> 21:00.092
now I'm into someone
else who isn't completely insane, huh?

21:00.717 --> 21:01.718
Hey, babe.

21:24.700 --> 21:27.160
Can you take a look at this
and see if it's right?

21:27.244 --> 21:28.078
I wasn't sure.

21:28.161 --> 21:29.162
Oh…

21:30.956 --> 21:32.582
- Okay.
- I-ra.

21:35.585 --> 21:38.130
Don't do this, I-ra. Let's start over.

21:38.213 --> 21:40.424
What are you doing?
Ow, that hurts! Ow!

21:40.507 --> 21:41.591
Please.

21:45.762 --> 21:48.098
You're gonna pay my girl back
every damn penny.

21:48.181 --> 21:50.851
And don't touch her again
if you'd like to walk out of here alive.

21:53.979 --> 21:56.857
The sweet smell of money!

21:56.940 --> 21:59.109
Whoo!

21:59.192 --> 22:01.361
Smell it. Ah!

22:01.445 --> 22:03.655
Ah!

22:03.739 --> 22:05.782
Oh yeah! Come on! Come on!

22:05.866 --> 22:06.783
Oh!

22:06.867 --> 22:08.493
Aw, do it. Do it again.

22:08.577 --> 22:09.453
Aw, yeah!

22:10.037 --> 22:11.371
Aw!

22:12.748 --> 22:13.790
Okay, last one!

22:52.913 --> 22:53.747
Hello there.

23:00.670 --> 23:02.547
Just getting back from visiting home?

23:04.466 --> 23:06.551
- Yeah.
- That's great.

23:08.220 --> 23:09.638
When's your next break?

23:09.721 --> 23:11.139
Wanna take a week vacation?

23:12.265 --> 23:14.476
We could go all the way to Shanghai

23:14.559 --> 23:15.977
or maybe Japan?

23:16.686 --> 23:17.604
Or Guam?

23:22.818 --> 23:23.777
When did you return?

23:23.860 --> 23:24.903
Just this morning.

23:26.780 --> 23:27.614
How's your cold?

23:27.697 --> 23:28.698
It's okay now.

23:31.576 --> 23:32.619
That's good to hear.

23:34.162 --> 23:35.997
I'm tired. I'm going inside.

23:36.081 --> 23:36.915
Hey,

23:37.499 --> 23:38.875
say what's been bothering you.

23:41.586 --> 23:44.047
Just speak your mind
and stop being so frustrating.

23:46.842 --> 23:49.386
If I say what I want to,
I might say something I'll regret later.

23:49.469 --> 23:50.762
Go ahead. Say it anyway.

23:50.846 --> 23:53.056
Even if you might regret it,
I'm willing to hear you out.

23:55.725 --> 24:00.439
Go on, ask me… if we did anything.
It's what you wanna know, am I right?

24:00.522 --> 24:01.940
- What?
- What, it isn't?

24:02.023 --> 24:04.901
Come on, you were imagining
a lot of things, weren't you?

24:04.985 --> 24:07.362
Or is it because you
don't have the balls to get angry?

24:08.738 --> 24:10.866
Wow, so much for you saying you're sorry.

24:12.576 --> 24:14.619
Do you even feel bad for what you did?

24:15.120 --> 24:17.581
Well, what right do I have
to get mad at you?

24:17.664 --> 24:20.375
I have no say at all
what happens between the two of you.

24:21.042 --> 24:23.170
I just want to know
what you're doing with me right now.

24:23.753 --> 24:25.672
I thought it wouldn't matter to me

24:25.755 --> 24:29.384
if you were just having a little fun
or taking a break or feeling lonely.

24:29.885 --> 24:31.887
I liked you,
and I thought I could handle it.

24:31.970 --> 24:33.638
I didn't care
if you had no feelings for me.

24:38.143 --> 24:40.061
And now I know
I can't handle this anymore.

24:41.771 --> 24:43.648
I get why I wouldn't be your type,

24:43.732 --> 24:45.358
'cause I'm just some guy.

24:52.115 --> 24:53.867
You just left me there by myself.

24:54.784 --> 24:56.244
You take everything too far.

25:01.416 --> 25:02.334
Oh!

25:18.350 --> 25:19.726
Hey, wait, Won-jun.

25:19.809 --> 25:21.686
You're staying here
over winter break, right?

25:21.770 --> 25:22.896
Our landlady was asking us.

25:22.979 --> 25:26.316
Actually, I'm moving out.
I better give her notice, then.

25:28.360 --> 25:30.278
What? Are you serious?

25:30.862 --> 25:31.780
Why?

26:25.000 --> 26:27.294
Yes,
I'm doing my best to sort things out.

26:27.377 --> 26:29.421
Yes, I'll update you
as soon as I have news.

26:29.504 --> 26:30.422
I apologize for this.

26:45.604 --> 26:46.438
Why'd you do it?

26:48.773 --> 26:49.691
Lee Doona.

26:58.241 --> 27:00.035
I'm sure I told you already.

27:03.079 --> 27:04.956
I can't sing. I just can't anymore.

27:08.835 --> 27:09.753
All right then.

27:10.962 --> 27:12.130
Take a break for now.

27:39.407 --> 27:40.700
Yes, President Ma.

27:41.785 --> 27:42.744
It's not happening.

27:43.244 --> 27:45.747
We're pulling Doona out.
It'll be a four-person group.

27:46.247 --> 27:47.165
I'm sorry.

28:20.240 --> 28:21.366
Welcome.

28:55.817 --> 28:57.152
You can't be serious.

28:57.777 --> 28:59.821
So you
really have given up on singing.

28:59.904 --> 29:00.822
Why not?

29:02.073 --> 29:03.616
I sleep when I want to,

29:03.700 --> 29:05.118
eat whatever I want to,

29:05.201 --> 29:06.578
and sit around doing nothing.

29:07.203 --> 29:08.371
Did you enjoy it, then?

29:09.539 --> 29:11.291
Watching us crash and burn like that?

29:12.333 --> 29:14.586
I knew you would think that, but no.

29:15.545 --> 29:16.796
You should've had more success.

29:18.173 --> 29:19.132
Tell me about it.

29:20.842 --> 29:23.136
At the time, I would've loved
shoving that in your face.

29:29.267 --> 29:30.185
I remember

29:31.644 --> 29:33.772
you said
you couldn't sing at all that day.

29:35.315 --> 29:36.274
I believe you, Doona.

29:39.611 --> 29:40.862
And I did back then too.

29:43.948 --> 29:45.325
I know we weren't always

29:46.326 --> 29:47.994
the greatest group members or friends,

29:49.078 --> 29:51.247
But we were supposed
to be in this together.

29:53.124 --> 29:54.626
So we all understand.

29:56.377 --> 29:58.338
To be honest,
I was thinking you'd feel resentful.

29:59.506 --> 30:01.633
If you hadn't done what you did back then,

30:02.717 --> 30:03.885
I would have soon enough.

30:10.141 --> 30:11.559
You know I don't actually

30:12.644 --> 30:13.478
hate you, right?

30:16.064 --> 30:18.650
I just wanted to be like you,
and I couldn't at all.

30:20.360 --> 30:22.403
And I didn't want to hate myself for it,

30:23.696 --> 30:25.782
so that's why I always hated you instead.

30:38.419 --> 30:39.963
10 YEARS LATER GROUND

30:53.434 --> 30:55.603
Sorry,
we're closed for the night.

31:01.651 --> 31:03.486
I left a few things
in the drawer the other day.

31:03.570 --> 31:05.029
Oh, okay.

31:05.738 --> 31:06.781
Well, come on in, then.

31:25.091 --> 31:27.093
- Sorry, could you move?
- Oh. Oh, sure.

31:49.908 --> 31:51.743
So are you still living in a studio?

31:52.785 --> 31:54.996
No, I found an apartment a few days ago.

31:55.079 --> 31:58.458
It's little far from school, though,
but I like it a lot.

31:58.541 --> 32:01.461
And it's definitely way better than having
to commute from my parents' home.

32:02.295 --> 32:03.296
Glad to hear that.

32:05.298 --> 32:08.301
How does it feel to be dating now?
Are you happy?

32:14.390 --> 32:17.226
I wanted to give you and Doona some space.

32:18.686 --> 32:20.104
You're different with her.

32:20.647 --> 32:22.690
It's a side of you
I've never seen, you know?

32:23.524 --> 32:25.401
She brings out a whole new Won-Jun.

32:28.237 --> 32:29.822
Hey.

32:29.906 --> 32:32.283
Just for the record,
I think it's a good change for you.

32:33.952 --> 32:35.703
Hey, I'm being serious.

32:36.829 --> 32:38.831
Lee Won-jun, head over heels.

32:38.915 --> 32:41.000
That's a rare thing to see.

32:48.257 --> 32:51.928
You are invited to
my Samba Party of Unity and Forgiveness!

32:52.011 --> 32:53.763
Place, the Sharehouse bar.

32:53.846 --> 32:57.058
- Time, right now. Hostess, Choi I-ra.
- Choi I-ra is so funny.

32:59.894 --> 33:00.895
Are you going?

33:01.729 --> 33:03.690
I'm sure everyone would like to see you.

33:04.816 --> 33:06.359
Hmm…

33:07.151 --> 33:08.236
I can't.

33:11.072 --> 33:12.573
You were the one who said

33:12.657 --> 33:15.076
not to let anyone hurt me anymore,
didn't you?

33:15.910 --> 33:17.412
Later, when I thought about it,

33:17.996 --> 33:20.915
I realized that I mistreated myself
the most out of everyone.

33:23.543 --> 33:26.671
And that's why I shouldn't be
friends with you for now, okay?

33:28.381 --> 33:30.216
I'm still hurt, you see.

33:34.345 --> 33:35.263
But who knows?

33:35.346 --> 33:36.764
I hope one day when I see you,

33:36.848 --> 33:39.350
I won't feel as badly
and we can be friends again.

33:40.518 --> 33:42.645
I think I just need
a little time for now, you know?

33:44.230 --> 33:46.399
I hope that you understand, Won-Jun.

34:02.707 --> 34:05.293
Come on. You were imagining
a lot of things, weren't you?

34:05.376 --> 34:07.462
Or is it because you
don't have the balls to get angry?

34:09.380 --> 34:11.424
Wow, so much for you saying you're sorry.

34:13.217 --> 34:15.053
Do you even feel bad for what you did?

34:15.762 --> 34:17.513
I thought it wouldn't matter to me

34:17.597 --> 34:20.141
if you were just having a little fun
or taking a break,

34:20.224 --> 34:21.684
or if you were feeling lonely.

34:21.768 --> 34:23.811
I liked you,
and I thought I could handle it.

34:23.895 --> 34:25.563
I didn't care
if you had no feelings for me.

34:28.316 --> 34:30.485
And now I know
I can't handle this anymore.

34:49.670 --> 34:50.671
You're moving out?

34:51.255 --> 34:52.507
Yes.

34:52.590 --> 34:54.675
- Where to?
- Well, I don't know yet.

34:55.843 --> 34:57.303
What if I begged you not to move out?

35:00.973 --> 35:03.059
- Do I really have to answer that?
- Yes, you do.

35:09.315 --> 35:10.566
Would you please get out?

35:28.626 --> 35:31.838
- Let go of me. You smell like tobacco.
- But I quit.

35:33.381 --> 35:34.549
It's probably his, then.

35:38.636 --> 35:40.138
So you're the jealous type, aren't you?

35:41.430 --> 35:42.515
What is it?

35:43.015 --> 35:44.475
Did he not want you anymore?

35:45.184 --> 35:46.561
Is that why you came back to me?

35:46.644 --> 35:48.855
Quit while you're ahead
and it's cute still.

35:53.860 --> 35:55.153
I'm not going anywhere.

35:56.154 --> 35:58.281
You'll have to drag me out of here
otherwise, huh?

35:58.364 --> 36:00.575
Listen, Doona,
I told you I don't want you in here!

36:00.658 --> 36:04.036
- So why can't you just leave me alone?
- 'Cause I want to be around someone.

36:04.120 --> 36:05.830
That doesn't have to be me.
I don't have to.

36:05.913 --> 36:06.747
You do have to.

36:08.082 --> 36:09.500
You have to be the one.

36:16.215 --> 36:17.216
Then, why did you do it?

36:19.343 --> 36:20.803
Because I didn't know that…

36:22.346 --> 36:24.640
that the person I didn't want to lose

36:26.017 --> 36:27.185
was you, okay?

36:30.396 --> 36:32.231
I don't have a lot of experience,

36:32.315 --> 36:35.401
and I'm even slower
when it comes to my own feelings.

36:36.944 --> 36:39.113
I take things for granted
until they're gone.

36:39.614 --> 36:40.990
And then I regret it.

36:42.116 --> 36:43.868
I can't help it. It drives me crazy.

36:45.786 --> 36:48.915
So why can't you, um,
forgive me just this once?

36:51.000 --> 36:53.461
You really are a mess. You know that?

36:54.170 --> 36:56.005
You're selfish and unstable, and

36:56.631 --> 36:58.925
you hurt me without even
thinking twice about it.

37:00.092 --> 37:01.594
I feel conflicted because

37:02.178 --> 37:04.764
you came and totally
flipped my world upside down.

37:05.431 --> 37:06.891
But even still, I feel like

37:08.351 --> 37:11.270
I'm going crazy because I want
to be the one that you want.

37:16.901 --> 37:18.694
So tell me you're really sorry.

37:23.407 --> 37:24.450
I'm sorry.

37:24.533 --> 37:25.993
And that I'm what you want.

37:27.495 --> 37:29.914
Tell me that you only have eyes for me
and not that guy!

37:33.125 --> 37:34.001
Can you?

37:37.255 --> 37:38.172
I love you.

38:08.828 --> 38:09.662
Won-jun.

38:11.163 --> 38:11.998
Hmm?

38:13.207 --> 38:14.875
Please don't hate me.

38:15.960 --> 38:17.295
I don't hate you.

38:18.796 --> 38:19.922
Believe me, I tried.

38:20.798 --> 38:22.174
But I just couldn't.

38:23.968 --> 38:25.386
I don't mean now.

38:26.262 --> 38:27.430
I mean, going forward.

38:30.057 --> 38:31.475
I promise I won't.

38:34.770 --> 38:36.480
Does this mean we made up?

38:37.773 --> 38:38.691
Mm-hmm.

38:40.109 --> 38:41.819
Really? So easily?

38:43.112 --> 38:44.822
I've always been easy.

38:44.905 --> 38:46.824
I was just pretending to be difficult.

38:56.751 --> 38:58.085
It has to be you

38:58.627 --> 38:59.545
for me too.

39:17.313 --> 39:21.359
Do you remember the song
that I gave up writing halfway through?

39:21.859 --> 39:24.195
We were working
on our second album, I think.

39:26.614 --> 39:28.324
I had forgotten the melody,

39:29.992 --> 39:31.410
but it came back to me.

39:35.039 --> 39:36.957
- That's good.
- It is.

39:38.918 --> 39:42.546
I wonder if it came back to me
because I've been feeling happier.

39:47.426 --> 39:49.303
You should drink that.
You did order it.
